            {
                "node": {
                    "id": "18107866399903836",
                    "text": "Windows has been a pile of garbage since before Windows 7. A lot of pre-built PC hardware sucks. I refuse to spend any money on a Dell, HP, or Acer plastic piece of shit that comes with McAfee, copilot, and all the bullshit pre-installed. Windows is ONLY good for gaming these days and even then Valve’s proton layer is so good you almost don’t even need Windows anymore. I installed Bazzite and CachyOS on the PC I built and never went back to windows. \n\nAlso if you’re an actual developer who uses terminal any Unix based OS (MacOS or Linux) is much better than DOS in my opinion.",
